c(p,'Correct registration mistakes','New owner','Try a blank required field, invalid email and mismatched passwords separately.|Try a 7-character, letters-only and numbers-only password.|Correct the values and continue.','Clear messages identify the problem. Correcting it works without creating duplicate schools.','Use a new unused inbox for a disposable registration.')
