c(p,'Sign in with Google','Google user','Choose Continue with Google.|Select the assigned Google account.|Check your name and picture in Account.|Sign out and sign in again.','The intended account opens. Missing name/photo are filled from Google; existing saved details are preserved.','Coordinator has configured Google sign-in and provided a controlled Google account.','Google setup required')
c(p,'Recover a forgotten password','Staff or parent','Choose Forgot password and enter your controlled email.|Open the reset message.|Set a new password and sign in.|Try the old password and reuse the reset link.','New password works. Old password and reused link fail. Do not copy the reset link into your report.','A working test inbox. Student passwords are reset through the school, not this email flow.','Email required')
