start='''<h1>SchoolOs feature testing pack</h1><p>Test one feature at a time and tell us what worked, what failed and what felt confusing. Your coordinator will give you the right account and the packet or case numbers to complete.</p><div class="notice"><strong>Start here:</strong> extract the ZIP folder first. Open your assigned file from <strong>feature-packs</strong> in Chrome, Edge, Firefox or Safari. You do not need to install a testing tool.</div><section class="card"><h2 style="margin-top:0">Five simple steps</h2><ol><li>Ask your coordinator for the test app address, account and assigned cases.</li><li>Open your packet and fill in your name, role, school and device.</li><li>Follow each short test. Tick Passed, Failed, Cannot test or leave Not tested.</li><li>Rate how intuitive, easy, beautiful and pleasant the feature felt. Add honest comments and suggestions.</li><li>Choose <strong>Download completed report</strong> and <strong>Download backup</strong>. Send both downloaded files and any separate screenshots to your coordinator.</li></ol><p>The checklist does not send answers to SchoolOs. Answers stay in the browser when permitted; the original checklist file is not your completed report. Download regularly, especially before changing device or browser.</p><p>To continue on another device, copy the packet and your backup there. Open <strong>Continue from a saved backup</strong> inside that packet and choose the backup file.</p><p>For paper testing, print the checklist, write your answers and return clear photos/scans. For a filled electronic report, open the downloaded report and use Print or save as PDF.</p></section>'''
